# --- Internal docs / agent scratch (kept local, not committed) ---
# Markdown docs are project notes, not part of the shipped app. Keep
# only the root README so GitHub's repo page still has a description.
*.md
# Leading slash anchors this exception to the repo root, so subdirectory
# READMEs (e.g. Airtel_Money_Project/README.md) stay ignored.
!/README.md
# Test statements + any other ad-hoc PDFs sitting in the working tree.
*.pdf
# Claude Code's local agent state and any "skills" scratch directories.
.claude/
**/.claude/
skills/
**/skills/
